  "description": "MEKQIG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C138 H116 Dy8 N16 Na4 O49 P8)n,1.5(C1 H4 O1),5.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.777-4.378 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.72-126.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C138H114Dy8Na4N16O49P8.",
